# AI-AutoCut local configuration example.
#
# Copy this file to a local, untracked location and fill in real values.
# Never commit a populated copy of this file.
#
#   cp config/examples/autocut.env.example .env.local
#   scripts/with-local-env python3 -m unittest discover -s tests -v
#
# Every location is a logical role. The local wrapper loads this file only for
# its child command; nothing here is defaulted to a home
# directory, so an unset required role fails with the variable name to set
# rather than silently reading someone else's disk.
# See docs/architecture/operations.md.

# Runtime workspace: job state, intermediate artifacts, staging.
AUTOCUT_WORKSPACE=/path/to/autocut-workspace

# External media root: source footage, renders, delivered media.
# Never inside the repository.
AUTOCUT_MEDIA_ROOT=/path/to/autocut-media

# Read-only historical R&D evidence. Optional.
AUTOCUT_LEGACY_WORKSPACE=/path/to/legacy-evidence

# ASCII-safe staging for DaVinci Resolve.
# Resolve Free 21.0.0 fails silently on non-ASCII I/O paths, so this must be an
# ASCII-only path even when the media root is not.
AUTOCUT_ASCII_STAGING=/path/to/ascii-staging

# External production storage root for heavy media: frames, proxies, previews,
# intermediate renders, temporary audio and working media.
#
# The job workspace resolves to
#   <AUTOCUT_PRODUCTION_ROOT>/AI-AutoCut-Staging/<job-id>/
# and completed jobs archive beneath
#   <AUTOCUT_PRODUCTION_ROOT>/AI-AutoCut-Archive/jobs/<job-id>/
#
# If this root is not mounted and writable, production is BLOCKED rather than
# continued on the internal disk. See docs/architecture/operations.md.
AUTOCUT_PRODUCTION_ROOT=/path/to/production-storage

# --- One-time internal override (Producer authorization only) --------------
# Names exactly ONE job id permitted to produce on internal storage while the
# external production root is unavailable. Never a boolean, never a default.
# Even then, internal production must leave a 30 GB free-space floor intact.
#
# AUTOCUT_INTERNAL_PRODUCTION_JOB=

# Editor application locations. Optional unless a backend is used.
DAVINCI_PATH=/path/to/DaVinci Resolve.app
JIANYING_PATH=/path/to/JianyingPro.app

# --- Provider credentials -------------------------------------------------
# Referenced by NAME only. Never commit a value, and never write a real key
# into a tracked file, a log, an example, or a report.
#
# AUTOCUT_AUDIO_PROVIDER_API_KEY=
